{"id":"5473eb1b238df94f","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness.md","title":"满足赋值与独立集的精确对应","display":"thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness — 满足赋值与独立集的精确对应","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness","aliases":["73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness"],"display":"thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness — 满足赋值与独立集的精确对应","depends_on":["[[73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph]]","[[73-df-independent-set-language]]","[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.2, Theorem 10.18, print pp. 460–462; PDF pp. 482–484","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-three-sat-independent-set-correctness — 满足赋值与独立集的精确对应"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02358e8c320b1ace\" href=\"?note=02358e8c320b1ace\" title=\"73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph\">73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ffeeb732a24b7769\" href=\"?note=ffeeb732a24b7769\" title=\"73-df-independent-set-language\">73-df-independent-set-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" href=\"?note=3eb1d15e0e8f389d\" title=\"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat\">73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2, Theorem 10.18, print pp. 460–462; PDF pp. 482–484"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C,m,N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}\">\\(\\mathbf C,m,N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02358e8c320b1ace\" href=\"?note=02358e8c320b1ace\" title=\"73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph\">73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph</a>；布尔式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}\\)</span> 在下式构造。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i&lt;m\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i&lt;m\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}⟧_\\nu=1\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{GI}^U(N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C},m)\\in\\mathsf{IS}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}⟧_\\nu=1\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{GI}^U(N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C},m)\\in\\mathsf{IS}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>满足赋值让每个子句选一个真文字；不会同时选互补文字，得到大小 m 的独立集。反向，子句内部为团，所以至少 m 个独立顶点意味着每个子句恰选一个；互补边保证可以一致赋值，其余变量任取。构造最多 3m 个顶点和平方数量的边；用本册的可解析布尔编码时给出总多项式归约，非法式映到固定否实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph","status":"resolved","id":"02358e8c320b1ace","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-independent-set-language","status":"resolved","id":"ffeeb732a24b7769","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-independent-set-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat","status":"resolved","id":"3eb1d15e0e8f389d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-boolean-syntax-and-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph","status":"resolved","id":"02358e8c320b1ace","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf C,m,N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}$ 见 [[73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph]]；布尔式 $\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}$ 在下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf C,m,N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Conj}(\\langle\\operatorname{Disj}(\\mathbf C(i)):0\\le i<m\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists\\nu:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathbf2\\;⟦\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}⟧_\\nu=1\\bigr)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{GI}^U(N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C},m)\\in\\mathsf{IS}.","display":true}],"bytes"